{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天结束，第三天也顺利考完了。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……还是会累呢。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar4092", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理也累了。”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "sk1002", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天的数学尽是考需要漫长计算的题目。希望能出点动脑的类型。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar4093", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“疲累的原因跟大家不同次元……”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，这样就只剩下明天而已了呢。”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "mu0428", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看见希望的光芒了。明天终于要结束了，安洁！”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 225, "voice": "sn0379", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是的、就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2163", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天……终于……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2164", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～？”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "pn0119", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们在脸红什么？”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ht0368", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没没没没没没没有什么都没有喔是的！”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2165", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“暖气好像开太强了……”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁去拜托一下调整温度吧！安洁要出发了，出发！”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2166", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2167", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁害羞得跑走，而我则是脸变得更红了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越接近最后一天，终于要实现约定的情绪就越来越高涨。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好可疑……”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "sk1003", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很可疑呢～”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ht0369", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天应该是比较冷才对。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar4094", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“热恋中的人不需要暖气呢。好环保喔，呵呵。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "mu0429", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar4095", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐，我们也不能输！一起来做环保吧！”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 225, "voice": "sn0380", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜噜噜？”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "pn0120", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像已经被大家（除去濑名同学和熊喵）发现我们之间有什么不寻常了……", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“～♪”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哈哈哈，还在装没事。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ht0370", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "故作平静的我，在某种意义上是恋爱中男生矜持的极致。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，连这种状况也能让人欣然接受，恋爱真的是一种罪过啊。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，时间一分一秒地接近。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概会成为我们的纪念日的那一天。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们没有冲动进行，而是确实地一步一步做准备──", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为“那一天”的那个行为是如此重要，所以连此时的一分一秒都成为了酝酿出气氛的助力。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
